WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:01,460
How dare you talk back?

2
00:00:01,460 --> 00:00:03,980
Disgusting rat carcasses stain the carriage

3
00:00:03,980 --> 00:00:06,460
As a child, you must be responsible

4
00:00:06,460 --> 00:00:07,980
Still say

5
00:00:07,980 --> 00:00:11,100
You want to become the same piece of meat as him?

6
00:00:11,100 --> 00:00:12,820
Don't be impulsive

7
00:00:12,820 --> 00:00:14,620
Let's just clean it up

8
00:00:16,030 --> 00:00:18,250
Kneel down and wipe it well

9
00:00:18,250 --> 00:00:20,450
Must be like the one I wiped

10
00:00:20,450 --> 00:00:22,310
You Shen Buran

11
00:00:22,310 --> 00:00:23,510
stop

12
00:00:23,510 --> 00:00:25,030
damn rat

13
00:00:25,030 --> 00:00:29,990
You stained my floor so so so so

14
00:00:30,270 --> 00:00:37,630
So you have to kneel down and lick me clean otherwise

15
00:00:37,630 --> 00:00:42,470
I pull out your tongue and Song Chen wipes the floor carefully

16
00:00:42,470 --> 00:00:46,880
Don't involve us, right?

17
00:00:46,880 --> 00:00:52,550
If you want me to mop the floor, let me

18
00:00:52,550 --> 00:00:53,590
Did you hear that right?
